    "Fini les petits sursauts d'interface : le verset du jour, les compteurs et les cartes s'affichent et se mettent à jour en douceur, partout dans l'app.": {
      "comment": "Description of a feature that makes the interface feel more stable, with smooth updates for the current verse, counters, and other UI elements across the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "وداعًا لاهتزازات الواجهة الصغيرة: آية اليوم والعدّادات والبطاقات تظهر وتتحدّث بسلاسة في كل أنحاء التطبيق."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No more little interface jumps: the verse of the day, counters, and cards now appear and update smoothly, everywhere in the app."
          }
        }
      }
