            "value": "White Days — Recommended fasting (13-14-15)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jours de réjouissance et de **Dhikr**. Multipliez le **Takbir** à voix haute, partagez le sacrifice avec famille, voisins et pauvres. Les 3 jours de **Tashreeq** (11-13) sont des jours de manger, de boire et d'évoquer Allah.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أيام فرح و**ذِكر**. أكثِر من **التكبير** جهرًا، وشارك الأضحية مع الأهل والجيران والفقراء. أيام **التشريق** الثلاثة (١١-١٣) أيام أكل وشرب وذكر لله."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Days of rejoicing and **Dhikr**. Say the **Takbir** abundantly out loud, and share the sacrifice with family, neighbors, and the poor. The 3 days of **Tashreeq** (11-13) are days of eating, drinking, and remembering Allah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
